      "review_description": "Buyer beware when using this company, They tried all the tricks in the book for more money, saying they didn't allow for cable runs this length, cant get cables where you want them, tried to convince you to install the inverter inside your house for their ease of instalment. When you refuse to pay the extra money, they'll come up with an excuse and that's the last you see of them. Nothing but bad, want more money when  on site and wont do as you ask.If this is service when it comes to an installation, you can bet there is no back up support when you have a problem.Stay well away form this company",
